Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 07:05:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: make unsigned command bar the owner magic-link sign-in

Visitors were typing the owner email into the ask field and hitting a
dead-end "Sign in as the owner" banner because sign-in was hidden behind
the E avatar. The hero bar is now email + Send link when unsigned, and
only becomes Ask once a session exists.

Also replace the unregistered sb_publishable fallback with the working
JWT anon key, and surface flock-ask's live NOT_FOUND as an honest
undeployed-backend message.
